  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "Implements the complete UDP transport layer: `UDPSocket` class using `NWConnection`/`NWListener` with broadcast mode, plus async `sendPacket()` and `receivePacket()` operations. Combines Python Steps 6-8 into one Swift step."))
